    ("requirement sign-off", "BrE /rɪˈkwaɪəmənt ˈsaɪn ɒf/", "AmE /ɹɪˈkwɑɪɹmənt ˈsɑɪn ˈɔf/", "需求签核", "Requirement sign-off is what makes a project owner's budget hold.", "需求签核是让项目负责人预算成立的关键。"),
    ("construction milestone", "BrE /kənˈstrʌkʃn ˈmaɪlstəʊn/", "AmE /kəˈnstɹʌkʃən ˈmɑɪˌlstoʊn/", "施工节点", "Construction milestones should be tied to payment, not to optimism.", "施工节点应当与付款挂钩，而不是与乐观挂钩。"),
    ("commissioning", "BrE /ˌkɒmɪˈʃənɪŋ/", "AmE /kəˈmɪʃənɪŋ/", "试运行；投产", "Commissioning reveals the gaps that acceptance testing missed.", "试运行会暴露验收测试漏掉的缺口。"),
    ("snagging", "BrE /ˈsnæɡɪŋ/", "AmE /ˈsnæɡɪŋ/", "收尾整改", "Snagging lists should be closed before the rent starts.", "收尾整改清单应当在租金起算前关闭。"),
    ("handover certificate", "BrE /ˈhændəʊvə səˌtɪfɪkət/", "AmE /ˈhændoʊvɚ sɚˈtɪfɪkət/", "移交证书", "Handover certificates are worthless without a defects list.", "移交证书如果没有缺陷清单，就毫无价值。"),
    ("defects liability", "BrE /ˈdiːfekts laɪəˈbɪləti/", "AmE /ˈdifɛkts ˌlɑɪəˈbɪlɪti/", "缺陷责任期", "Defects liability periods should be enforced, not hoped for.", "缺陷责任期应当被严格执行，而不是靠期待。"),
    ("post-completion review", "BrE /ˌpəʊst kəmˈpliːʃn rɪˌvjuː/", "AmE /ˈpoʊst kəˈmpliʃən ˌɹiˈvju/", "竣工后复盘", "Post-completion reviews are the only honest source of estimates.", "竣工后复盘是估算方面唯一诚实的来源。"),
    ("value realisation", "BrE /ˈvæljuː rɪələˈzeɪʃn/", "AmE /ˈvælju ˈɹiləˌzéɪʃən/", "价值实现", "Value realisation should be checked against the original case, annually.", "价值实现应当每年对照当初的论证核验一次。"),
    ("variance against case", "BrE /ˈveəriəns əˌɡenst keɪs/", "AmE /ˈvɛɹiəns əˈɡɛnst ˈkéɪs/", "对比论证的差异", "Variance against case should distinguish scope from price.", "对比论证的差异，应当区分范围变化与价格变化。"),
