    ("close report", "BrE /ˈkləʊz rɪˌpɔːt/", "AmE /ˈkloʊs ɹiˈpɔɹt/", "结项报告", "Close reports are read by nobody and cited by everybody.", "结项报告没人读，却人人引用。"),
    ("reinvestment", "BrE /ˌriːɪnˈvestmənt/", "AmE /ˌɹiɪˈnvɛstmənt/", "再投资", "Reinvestment should be compared with returning the cash to shareholders.", "再投资应当与把钱还给股东做比较。"),
    ("cannibalisation", "BrE /ˌkænɪbəlaɪˈzeɪʃn/", "AmE /ˌkænəbəlɪˈzéɪʃən/", "自我蚕食；市场蚕食", "Cannibalisation is real when the new product takes the old one's customers.", "当新产品夺走老产品的客户时，自我蚕食才是真实存在的。"),
    ("portfolio balance", "BrE /pɔːtˈfəʊliəʊ ˌbæləns/", "AmE /pɔˈɹtfoʊliˌoʊ ˈbæləns/", "组合均衡", "Portfolio balance protects against betting everything on one technology.", "组合均衡能避免把全部筹码押在单一技术上。"),
    ("appraisal", "BrE /əˈpreɪzl/", "AmE /əˈpɹéɪzəl/", "评估；评价", "Appraisals are read once, so put the decision in the first line.", "评估报告只会被读一次，因此决定要写在第一行。"),
    ("capital commitment", "BrE /ˈkæpɪtl kəˈmɪtmənt/", "AmE /ˈkæpətəl kəˈmɪtmənt/", "资本承诺", "Capital commitments create obligations that survive the project plan.", "资本承诺产生的义务，会比项目计划活得更久。"),
    ("disposal decision", "BrE /dɪˈspəʊzl dɪˌsɪʒn/", "AmE /dɪˈspoʊzəl dɪˈsɪʒən/", "处置决策", "Disposal decisions should compare against keeping and fixing.", "处置决策应当与“继续持有并维修”做比较。"),
    ("obsolescence", "BrE /ˌɒbsəˈlesns/", "AmE /ˌɑbsəˈlɛsəns/", "过时；淘汰", "Obsolescence can arrive through regulation rather than technology.", "过时也可能由法规而非技术带来。"),
    ("decommissioning cost", "BrE /ˌdiːkəˈmɪʃənɪŋ kɒst/", "AmE /dikəˈmɪʃənɪŋ ˈkɑst/", "退役成本", "Decommissioning costs belong in the original appraisal, not the disposal note.", "退役成本应当计入最初的投资评估，而不是写在处置附注里。"),
    ("ramp-up cost", "BrE /ˈræmp ʌp kɒst/", "AmE /ˈɹæmp ˈʌp ˈkɑst/", "爬坡成本", "Ramp-up costs are the most commonly forgotten line in a project.", "爬坡成本是项目中最常被漏掉的一项。"),
    ("steady-state cost", "BrE /ˈstedi steɪt kɒst/", "AmE /ˈstɛdi ˈstéɪt ˈkɑst/", "稳态成本", "Steady-state costs should be compared to the revenue they actually support.", "稳态成本应当与它们实际支撑的收入做比较。"),
    ("investment thesis", "BrE /ɪnˈvestmənt ˈθɪsɪs/", "AmE /ˌɪˈnvɛstmənt ˈθisəs/", "投资论点", "Investment theses should be falsifiable in one sentence.", "投资论点应当能用一句话被证伪。"),
